IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `nrfa-grants`

-- National Research Fund Act 2006, ss 3, 5(2), 7(2), 9, 12(2), 14-17 -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_national-research-fund-act-2006.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

